chapter.v:
	‘At the 

	 beginnings of your months you shall present a burnt offering to the Lord: two young bulls, one ram, and seven lambs in their first year, without blemish;
 [Num. 10:10;]

	three-tenths of 

	 an ephah of fine flour as a grain offering, mixed with oil, for each bull; two-tenths of an ephah of fine flour as a grain offering, mixed with oil, for the one ram;
 [Num. 15:4-12]
